{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hi Jolene! We haven't corresponded for a long time!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-52d14a086cd5ff5802f13402", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:10:42.377356+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "52d14a086cd5ff5802f13402", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "52d14a086cd5ff5802f13402", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Deb, yeah life can get chaotic. How's it been going lately?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-de196565fa79251f1fb0d3f8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:10:46.508736+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "de196565fa79251f1fb0d3f8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "de196565fa79251f1fb0d3f8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: So much has been going on lately. I started this yoga class in the neighborhood - it's such a good feeling! Now I get to share the exercise with my neighbors and watch it really transform them."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-56918c5b3dd36e637a145d09", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:10:50.660134+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "56918c5b3dd36e637a145d09", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "56918c5b3dd36e637a145d09", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Congrats. How did you do this?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-265486fb0249d51df067ea1c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:10:54.795994+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "265486fb0249d51df067ea1c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "265486fb0249d51df067ea1c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Thanks! My neighbors were interested in trying yoga, so I hosted a class for them on Friday. It was great to see everyone embrace and enjoy it. Here is our photo together."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-8f402f29b153d326ebaeaab9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:10:58.920353+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8f402f29b153d326ebaeaab9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8f402f29b153d326ebaeaab9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: That's cool! What made you want to start teaching it?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-455b2390031b4fe820970ffe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:03.026020+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "455b2390031b4fe820970ffe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "455b2390031b4fe820970ffe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I find it calming and wanted to share that with others. Giving people peace and awareness brings me so much happiness."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-ab54cda7ba57a24efa4c227b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:07.162572+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ab54cda7ba57a24efa4c227b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ab54cda7ba57a24efa4c227b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Wow, Deb! It's awesome when we can share something we love and make things better for others."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-84e186763392141b61efa21e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:11.278757+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "84e186763392141b61efa21e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "84e186763392141b61efa21e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Teaching it is awesome because it can help others and I've made such great friends through it. It's really nice for building community connections."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-bdf95bb308625661cdca0dd2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:15.386377+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bdf95bb308625661cdca0dd2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bdf95bb308625661cdca0dd2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: That's really motivating. It's great to have support in tough times."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-afc100e8bb590eceb5fde004", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:19.490547+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "afc100e8bb590eceb5fde004", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "afc100e8bb590eceb5fde004", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's one of life's best parts, right?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-2e9e4d0396709565c9036b60", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:23.640784+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2e9e4d0396709565c9036b60", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2e9e4d0396709565c9036b60", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Yeah, having someone to rely on is key in tough times. It really makes a difference in how we handle life. Plus, there's something I wanted to tell you."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-03a117a3b0b1159af5054f54", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:27.761064+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "03a117a3b0b1159af5054f54", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "03a117a3b0b1159af5054f54", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: What's up? I'm listening. We'll figure it out."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-82b442fcd623749134198b25", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:31.865164+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "82b442fcd623749134198b25", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "82b442fcd623749134198b25", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'm having a hard time dealing with my Engineering assignments. It's a lot to manage and I'm struggling to keep up. Can we still talk about time management?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-44b5077e98100b0f15534f2a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:35.966183+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "44b5077e98100b0f15534f2a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "44b5077e98100b0f15534f2a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Sure, Jolene. Let's find a time that works for both of us."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-58f5cf3db56afedfd3dacb6f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:40.095786+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "58f5cf3db56afedfd3dacb6f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "58f5cf3db56afedfd3dacb6f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Let's find a time to chat - I'll check my schedule and get back to you."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-0056f4b27c9a706f9497a5ab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:44.204261+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0056f4b27c9a706f9497a5ab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0056f4b27c9a706f9497a5ab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Take your time, Jolene. We'll work it out. Take care of yourself, OK?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-36b8c23643cda65c3fa81d54", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:48.318174+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "36b8c23643cda65c3fa81d54", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "36b8c23643cda65c3fa81d54", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'll make sure to take it. See you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-5ba7db94b24b927c40c989d1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:52.429086+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ba7db94b24b927c40c989d1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ba7db94b24b927c40c989d1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I'm here for you if you need me. Let's catch up soon."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-0867e5d9e49ce7b25012a9e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:11:56.548949+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0867e5d9e49ce7b25012a9e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0867e5d9e49ce7b25012a9e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Have a great day!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-48/session_9-02071e584b78e00b92d47b8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:12:00.639421+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "02071e584b78e00b92d47b8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "02071e584b78e00b92d47b8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
